<title>INDIA: India's HCL copper prices for January, 1997.</title>
<headline>India's HCL copper prices for January, 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are copper/product prices for January, 1997, announced by the state-owned Hindustan Copper Ltd, and circulated by the Bombay Metal Exchange Ltd.</p>
<p>Prices effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>					  (in rupees per tonne)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					 Present Price    December Price</p>
<p>					 -------------    --------------</p>
<p>1.WIRE BARS (FULL)		112,000		  108,000</p>
<p>2.CATHODES - KCC/ICC	    109,000		  105,000</p>
<p>3.C.C.RODS - Standard  </p>
<p>  COILS (Ex - Taloja)	   117,000		  117,000</p>
<p>4.C.C.RODS -Non-Standard</p>
<p>  COILS (Ex - Taloja)	   116,000		  116,000</p>
<p>The above prices are exclusive of excise duty, octroi (entry tax), sales tax etc. which will be charged extra as applicable. The prices of Item No. 1, &amp; 2 are for deliveries ex-godown at Central Warehousing Corporation, Cotton Green, Bombay and for Item No. 3 &amp; 4 Ex-Our Taloja works. However,for C.C.Rods sales ex: godowns the prices are attached:</p>
<p>					Standard Coils  Non-Standard Coils</p>
<p>					--------------  ------------------</p>
<p>Ex-Bombay Godown		  Rs 1,17,350 PMT Rs 1,16,350  PMT</p>
<p>Ex-Goa Godown		     Rs 1,18,000 PMT Rs 1,17,000  PMT</p>
<p>Ex-Indore Godown		  Rs 1,17,600 PMT Rs 1,16,600  PMT</p>
<p>Ex-Silvasa Godown		 Rs 1,17,820 PMT Rs 1,16,820  PMT</p>
<p>The excise duty applicable for the above Ex:godown prices for C.C.Rods is the amount paid by the HCL plant at Taloja at the time of despatch of the particular consignment. Sales tax, octroi and other statutory levies will be charged extra as applicable.</p>
<p>Quantity Rebate Structure</p>
<p>--------------------------</p>
<p>Quantity Rebate applicable on C.C.Rods and ICC Copper</p>
<p>Cathodes would be as under:</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>     Quantity Lifted	 Rebate (Rs./MT)</p>
<p>during the month ------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				C.C.Rod	     ICC Cathode</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------  10 MT   25 MT		 500/-	     Nil</p>
<p> 25 MT   50 MT	     1,000/-	     500/-</p>
<p> 50 MT  100 MT	     1,500/-	   1,000/-</p>
<p>100 MT  150 mt		 ---	     1,500/-</p>
<p>150 MT and above		---	     2,000/-</p>
<p>100 MT  200</p>
<p>MT 2,000/- N.A.</p>
<p>200 MT and above	    2,500/-	     N.A.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
</text>
